liwin mi öch.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ekewe ät eman a nöüni lupwen an alüal","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ra usun chök ekewe föün esefich lepöün eman sounfiu.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"A feiöch ewe mwän mi ur an lenien föün esefich ren ei sokun föün.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ätewe esap säw, lupwen epwe kapas ngeni chon oputan lon lenien kapwüng.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/chk_bsm/PSA/127.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/chk_bsm/PSA/128.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/chk_bsm/PSA/126.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}